# written by `coltrane play` — the seat's instrument (0600) and the boot-owned session parameters.
# NEVER committed: vor.env carries a credential, and the others are regenerated every boot so a
# committed copy could only ever be a stale memory of a standing that has moved.
.claude/vor.env
.claude/coltrane-boot.settings.json
.claude/coltrane-boot.context.md
